// Dialog :
"P1302744292" "Apparently, those PCU students felt pretty inspired by the rescue, {HeroName}. I checked in with them and their families, and it looks like they've decided to continue helping the recycling drive, even after all that happened. <br><br>People sometimes ask how folks live in Paragon city. Events like this one today are the reason why people can live here, {HeroName}. Events like this, and people like you."
// RandomFameString :
"P3644361101" "Word is all over the PCU campus about {HeroName}'s daring rescue mission."

