// IntroString :
"P2873335710" "The Clockwork have been stepping up their activity in the Faultline region, stripping the abandoned buildings and the reconstruction sites of every bit of scrap of metal they can get to build more of themselves. The real worry is if they start to get into the dam. Clearing them out is a long term task, but every hero is needed to help keep their numbers down. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The city needs a heroes to go into Faultline and clear out Clockwork before they can do more harm.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4202025430" "Go to Faultline and defeat Clockwork"
// SendOffString :
"P3913694245" "Even though repairs have begun, Faultline can still be a dangerous place, {HeroName}. You may want to bring some allies with you. If you can destroy about 20 Clockwork, that should help out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P778482692" "Defeat Clockwork in Faultline"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1950143506" "Go to Faultline and defeat a total of about 20 Clockwork."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3328801766" "You have cleared out enough Clockwork for now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2384671567" "Good job fighting those Clockwork, {HeroName}. The last thing that stricken zone needs is those metal hungry machines eating away at everything."
